{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3v3 Online Multiplayer</strong><br>Team up with players around the world and compete in fast-paced, high-energy street basketball matches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1v1 Competitive Mode</strong><br>Test your skills in intense one-on-one matchups and prove your playstyle and individual performance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Career Mode (New)</strong><br>Experience a solo PVE mode featuring stage-based progression, roguelike elements, and long-term character growth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Practice &amp; Training Mode</strong><br>Improve your skills through various training systems and prepare for real matches.  </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Single Player &amp; PVE Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a fully developed single-player experience designed to help you grow at your own pace.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stage-based progression with character-specific content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic difficulty that adapts to your skill level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike elements that provide a fresh experience every run</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1292630/extras/195740eec436f3afd8b58785019669eb.avif?t=1775721619\" width=1560 height=891 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Free-to-Play Basketball Experience</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A free-to-play basketball game where your time and effort directly translate into meaningful progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy both solo and competitive modes with a deep and rewarding experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Real-Time Online Community</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with and against users across multiple platforms in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form teams, compete against rivals, and enjoy seamless matchmaking anytime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1292630/extras/41258d946d47a7585ff8e0ed3321370b.avif?t=1775721619\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Street Basketball Gameplay</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master intuitive controls and pull off stylish street basketball moves with ease.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a diverse roster of unique characters, each with their own skills and playstyles, and create your own strategy on the court.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1292630/extras/9bbbcf5aad0afddb1c0ff9000a48df29.avif?t=1775721619\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unreal Engine Lumen Graphics</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the latest update, 3on3 FreeStyle now features <strong>Unreal Engine Lumen-based graphics</strong>, delivering a more immersive and realistic visual experience.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time lighting that enhances the atmosphere of each match</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved reflections and indirect lighting for greater immersion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic environments that bring the court to life</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience sharper, more vibrant street basketball like never before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1292630/extras/d6360ed896785b7ba724238b44f30062.avif?t=1775721619\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"1c6524b9ff57152468db16c8d5cf37e08d1dd3ee.jpg","localized_name":"Hall of Fame","name":"Hall of Fame","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1292630/1c6524b9ff57152468db16c8d5cf37e08d1dd3ee.jpg"},{"icon":"1a1d8df416e7942e776afa7891d34fc09b3a32e7.jpg","localized_name":"Man of the Year","name":"Man of the Year","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1292630/1a1d8df416e7942e776afa7891d34fc09b3a32e7.jpg"},{"icon":"abdf712ead67bd7c237eeb594e35382b531d43ad.jpg","localized_name":"Master of 3on3 FreeStyle","name":"Master of 3on3 FreeStyle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1292630/abdf712ead67bd7c237eeb594e35382b531d43ad.jpg"},{"icon":"593b950afbafc1d86a434d0758b134f955563cf5.jpg","localized_name":"Madly Max","name":"Madly Max","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1292630/593b950afbafc1d86a434d0758b134f955563cf5.jpg"},{"icon":"4f0fe66482cf2b6f96c7608a364c990566fde065.jpg","localized_name":"Join E-Sports Team Now!","name":"Join E-Sports Team Now!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1292630/4f0fe66482cf2b6f96c7608a364c990566fde065.jpg"},{"icon":"7df1fde5bdbfaf0cf9ad245f53ca5729c5d1450c.jpg","localized_name":"Impossible is Nothing, Really?","name":"Impossible is Nothing, Really?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1292630/7df1fde5bdbfaf0cf9ad245f53ca5729c5d1450c.jpg"},{"icon":"a8fb75cbdc34850b4f40bee5010f2cd9893c87d8.jpg","localized_name":"The King of the Street","name":"The King of the Street","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1292630/a8fb75cbdc34850b4f40bee5010f2cd9893c87d8.jpg"},{"icon":"765ea5e006d82c27e7adbdd6681e09bcecfb4287.jpg","localized_name":"Thank you for losing","name":"Thank you for l